    "explanation": "The four essential attributes of a state are:\n\nPopulation: A defined group of people within the state.\n\nTerritory: A recognized geographical area with borders.\n\nGovernment: An organized system to enforce laws and administer policies.\n\nSovereignty: Supreme authority to govern without external interference."
